heck those strings.",{"es":"iconos","id":"ikon","it":"icone","ko":"아이콘","ms":"ikon","nl":"pictogrammen","pt":"ícones","ro":"pictograme","vi":"biểu tượng"}],["transparent","Adjective. Transparent background (PNG/GIF/TIFF).",{"da":"gennemsigtig","de":"transparent","es":"transparente","fr":"transparent","id":"transparan","it":"trasparente","ms":"lut sinar","nl":"transparant","no":"gjennomsiktig","pl":"przezroczysty","pt":"transparente","ro":"transparent","sv":"transparent","tr":"şeffaf","uk":"прозорий","vi":"trong suốt"}],["transparency","Noun. Image transparency (alpha channel).",{"da":"gennemsigtighed","de":"Transparenz","es":"transparencia","fr":"transparence","id":"transparansi","it":"trasparenza","ko":"투명도","ms":"ketelusan","nl":"transparantie","no":"gjennomsiktighet","pl":"przezroczystość","pt":"transparência","ro":"transparență","sv":"transparens","th":"ความโปร่งใส","tr":"şeffaflık","uk":"прозорість","vi":"độ trong suốt"}],["passport","Noun. Passport (passport photo tool).",{"es":"pasaporte","id":"paspor","it":"passaporto","ko":"여권","ms":"pasport","pl":"paszport","pt":"passaporte","ro":"pașaport","tr":"pasaport","uk":"паспорт","vi":"hộ chiếu"}],["uploading","Status text while files upload (\"Uploading…\").",{"it":"caricamento","pl":"przesyłanie","tr":"yükleniyor"}],["edges","Noun, plural. Image edges (soft edges, crop edges).",{"da":"kanter","de":"Kanten","es":"bordes","it":"bordi","ms":"tepi","nl":"randen","no":"kanter","pl":"krawędzie","pt":"bordas","ro":"margini","sv":"kanter","tr":"kenarlar","vi":"cạnh"}],["dimensions","Noun, plural. Image dimensions (width × height).",{"da":"dimensioner","fr":"dimensions","id":"dimensi","it":"dimensioni","ms":"dimensi","nl":"afmetingen","no":"dimensjoner","pl":"wymiary","pt":"dimensões","ro":"dimensiuni","tr":"boyutlar","uk":"розміри","vi":"kích thước"}],["pixel","Noun. Pixel; unit abbreviation is px.",{"da":"pixel","de":"Pixel","es":"píxel","fr":"pixel","id":"piksel","it":"pixel","ko":"픽셀","ms":"piksel","nl":"pixel","no":"